  "body": "* Motivated vendors have priced to sell, creating exceptional value in a tightly held coastal location\r\n* Brick and Insuclad with brand new external gutter system on the lower level.\r\n* Refreshed three-bedroom home with modern kitchen, two stylish bathrooms, fireplace and heat pump for year-round comfort\r\n* Newly completed patio, sunny covered porch and private low maintenance setting perfect for easy everyday living and entertaining\r\n* Walk to Little Manly Beach, Manly Village cafés, and Whangaparaoa Primary School via the nearby walkway\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of Manly's most desirable pockets, this beautifully maintained home offers the ideal blend of comfort, convenience and relaxed coastal living. Thoughtfully refreshed throughout, the hard work has already been done so you can simply move in and enjoy. Light-filled interiors, a modern functional kitchen, and flexible living spaces make this an ideal option for first home buyers, downsizers, professionals, or investors seeking an easy-care property in a premium location. Practical upgrades including newly replaced front guttering add further peace of mind, while the double internal access garage delivers excellent storage and secure parking.\r\n\r\nStep outside and enjoy the lifestyle that makes this location so sought after. The newly completed patio and sunny covered porch create inviting spaces to relax, entertain or enjoy quiet evenings at home. Just moments from Little Manly Beach and the vibrant Manly Village cafés, with easy walking access to Whangaparaoa Primary School, this is a property that truly enhances everyday living. With motivated vendors committed to moving on and clear instructions to meet the market, this is an opportunity buyers will want to act on quickly.\r\n\r\nTo view the property documents, copy this link into your browser: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/Y5N4",
